[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m Next, we need to find the sum of the positive divisors of \(362880\) that have units digit 1, which implies they are congruent to 1 modulo 10. 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m The odd divisors of \(362880\) are the divisors of \(3^4 \times 5 \times 7\). These odd divisors are:
