[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m Among these, the ones congruent to 1 modulo 10 are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m \[1, 21, 81, 1701\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m The sum of these divisors is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m \[1 + 21 + 81 + 1701 = 1804\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=130984)[0m 
